    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>jumpscare</strong> including <strong>horror game</strong> that lets you see the world from a different perspective. Experience the long night as human`s best friend, a <strong>dog</strong>. After returning home with your owner one day you notice in the middle of the night that she is not in her bed.\u00a0 Walk in first person perspective through the long night in search of your <strong>beloved</strong>\u00a0<strong>owner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While making your way through the mansion you have to avoid , hide or flee from a <strong>paranormal creature</strong> and along that you <strong>struggle\u00a0recognizing</strong>\u00a0 your very own home. But be careful, the creature is <strong>not</strong> <strong>alone</strong>....\u00a0Your journey will not only lead you through the mansion but also outside, since your path will sometimes be obscure you will need to <strong>find a balance between surviving and exploration.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>jumpscare</strong> including <strong>horror game</strong> that lets you see the world from a different perspective. Experience the long night as human`s best friend, a <strong>dog</strong>. After returning home with your owner one day you notice in the middle of the night that she is not in her bed.\u00a0 Walk in first person perspective through the long night in search of your <strong>beloved</strong>\u00a0<strong>owner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While making your way through the mansion you have to avoid , hide or flee from a <strong>paranormal creature</strong> and along that you <strong>struggle\u00a0recognizing</strong>\u00a0 your very own home. But be careful, the creature is <strong>not</strong> <strong>alone</strong>....\u00a0Your journey will not only lead you through the mansion but also outside, since your path will sometimes be obscure you will need to <strong>find a balance between surviving and exploration.</strong></p>",
